  "notes": "Shop.co Figma community template (Next.js + shadcn). Monochrome black/white system with fully pill-shaped (9999px) buttons, chips and inputs, 20px-radius image tiles on warm off-white #f0eeed, and gold stars as the only warm accent; green verified check beside reviewer names. Heavy Integral CF uppercase headings give a streetwear feel. Quantity stepper (− 1 +) in a grey pill has no codebook entry. Product gallery is a thumbnail column beside a large stage (only one image). Newsletter is a black rounded slab that straddles the white page and grey #f0f0f0 footer. Footer bottom row has payment-method logo chips. Review ellipsis buttons do nothing in the live copy. The related shelf includes the product currently being viewed."
}
